WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:32.866 --> 00:00:38.163
As the season turns, I recall the taste
of rice noodles from my hometown.

00:00:39.205 --> 00:00:43.877
What gave me strength
was the one with seasonal ingredients,

00:00:45.045 --> 00:00:46.588
the San Xian noodles.

00:00:50.884 --> 00:00:55.638
"THE RICE NOODLES"

00:01:01.978 --> 00:01:05.648
For many people in Hunan, the day begins

00:01:06.399 --> 00:01:08.818
with a bowl of hot, steaming noodles,

00:01:09.778 --> 00:01:13.656
sweat on their face
and taking in the moment.

00:01:16.993 --> 00:01:17.994
Two bowls.

00:01:18.703 --> 00:01:19.871
Thank you.

00:01:20.413 --> 00:01:25.418
My memories from childhood begin
at this noodle shop with no sign.

00:01:26.044 --> 00:01:27.128
Good morning.

